## Final Acceptance Criteria

- Every new Rust feature has:
  - CLI command
  - Python wrapper
  - env flag
  - Python fallback
  - Rust unit tests
  - Python route/wrapper tests
  - full CI pass through `mise exec -- ./scripts/ci.sh`
- Rust read-only SQLite commands use read-only connections and `query_only`.
- No application writes bypass the writer service.
- Live measurement notes show whether each Rust feature reduced:
  - route latency
  - Python process RSS after use
  - container cgroup anon memory
  - processing job stage time
